==English==

==={{acronym}}===
'''FYROM'''

# [[former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia]]. Used by the [[UN]] as a temporary name for the [[Republic of Macedonia]], until a solution for its name dispute with [[Greece]] is found.

====Usage notes====

Although the word "former" is intentionally not capitalized, as it is a "provisional designator", not the title for the state, the acronym "FYROM" is often used. It would would more properly be "fYRoM", but that is an awkward construction that is rarely used.

